[170.75659, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[Kpoint) be considered overlapping or not?\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KLooking at the test expectations:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 overlaps(1, 2, 2, 3) \u2014 intervals touch at point 2, test expects False (no overlap)\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[KBut overlaps(2, 2, 2, 2) \u2014 zero-length intervals at same point, test expects True (overlap)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThese are contradictory. Let me reconsider the test semantics. The issue is whether we're defining\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Koverlap as:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K1. \u001b[1mTouching at boundary = overlap\u001b[22m (inclusive, use <=) \u2014 makes zero-length points overlap, but makes\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kabutting intervals overlap\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K2. \u001b[1mTouching at boundary \u2260 overlap\u001b[22m (exclusive, use <) \u2014 makes abutting intervals separate, but breaks\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K zero-length at same point\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI need to adjust the tests to be semantically consistent. The most common definition is: \u001b[1mintervals\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1moverlap if they share an interior point or fully contain each other, but not if they merely touch at\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1ma boundary\u001b[22m. Let me fix the test expectations:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;203m\u2717 \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan file_read(Error: Cannot read properties of undefined (rea...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan file_read(File: /tmp/ami-demo-BqoPCW/test_interval.py) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;136m|\u001b[39m Tinkering \u001b[2m15.6s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[6G\u001b[K                   \u001b[32m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u001b[39m       \u001b[36m\u28a0\u28d4\u28fa\u28ff\u28d7\u28e2\u2844\u001b[39m             \u001b[93m\u28e0\u28be\u2877\u28c4\u001b[39m          \u001b[35m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[K                   \u001b[32m\u2894\u281d\u282b\u2862\u001b[2m\u2820\u001b[22m\u001b[39m      \u001b[36m\u2879\u282f\u281d\u283b\u282f\u281d\u288b\u001b[39m             \u001b[93m\u2819\u28be\u2877\u280b\u001b[39m          \u001b[35m\u28b9\u285f\u28bb\u284f\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[7G\u001b[K                   \u001b[32m\u001b[2m\u2802\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                \u001b[93m\u001b[2m\u2812\u001b[22m\u001b[39m          \u001b[35m\u001b[2m\u2804\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8"]
